      "text": "CA Playground is live.\n\nThe first tool that treats current affairs the way UPSC actually tests it.\n\nNot a PDF compilation. Not a monthly magazine. Not another summary you'll forget in a week.\n\nA structured, syllabus-mapped knowledge system built from the ground up for Mains and Essay — the kind of tool that didn't exist before because nobody built the pipeline to make it possible.\n\n• 5,500+ explainers. 230+ themes. GS 1–4 syllabus linked. PYQs mapped.\n\n• Every article broken into What / Why / Implications / Challenges / Solutions / Way Forward — the same structure you'll write your answer in. Essay angles, ethics dilemmas, data highlights, prelims facts — tagged and searchable. Articles weighted by their coverage in news. \n\nThree views:\n• List — Paper → Section → Syllabus Topic → Theme → Articles\n• Graph — Interactive knowledge graph. Themes as nodes, sized by news weight. Connections no compilation will show you.\n• PYQ — Start from the question. See which current affairs stories answer which Mains questions.\n\n• Bookmarks. Full-text search. Dark mode. Original newspaper clippings with highlighted lines. Mobile-ready.\n\nThis isn't an incremental improvement. It is CA redefined.\n\n4-hour free preview — full access, no restrictions.\nPlans from ₹999.\n\nCA Playground here : https://upscanalytics.opuslabs.in/knowledge-graph\n\nUPSC Analytics landing page : https://upscanalytics.opuslabs.in/\n\nContact on @upscanalyticsprelimspyqbobot for any queries. \n\nThanks !!\n\n@upscseeproanalytics",
